{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/e53091c1416c8075df2ff161af7071f4.poster.avif?t=1761137341\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/e53091c1416c8075df2ff161af7071f4.webm?t=1761137341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/e53091c1416c8075df2ff161af7071f4.mp4?t=1761137341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tobias and his younger brother Juno live a quiet life \u2014 until a mysterious crystal and a foreboding mage shatter it forever. After their encounter, Juno falls gravely ill, as if his very life force has been drained away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tobias is forced onto a quest he did not choose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Tobias\u2019s shoes and help him save his brother. Explore a magical medieval world with deep forests and dark caves, majestic cities and ancient castles with sewers and vast libraries. Forge new friendships, fight powerful enemies, and confront Tobias\u2019s inner demons as you search for the knowledge that could bring Juno back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Descend into the darkness,</i> <br><i>fight the evil inside</i> <br><i>and seek the wits to help those</i> <br><i>who once stood by your side.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/be092e76616235edf7516bea827e1d00.poster.avif?t=1761137341\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/be092e76616235edf7516bea827e1d00.webm?t=1761137341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/be092e76616235edf7516bea827e1d00.mp4?t=1761137341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern take on <strong>classic point-and-click gameplay</strong>, with <strong>logical puzzles</strong> and immersive exploration.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u201310 hours of <strong>story-driven adventure</strong> featuring unexpected twists and emotional stakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous <strong>hand-animated pixel art</strong> set in a dark medieval fantasy world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice acting</strong> accompanied by an original, <strong>atmospheric soundtrack</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>cast of unique characters</strong>, including caring healer Adelina, scruffy mystic Severin, and ominous mage Thaddeus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/88fe14a691ad97f461bbfadeb910469f.poster.avif?t=1761137341\" width=1170 height=349 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/88fe14a691ad97f461bbfadeb910469f.webm?t=1761137341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620350?t=1761137341","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/88698d65f6ccddeaeb75b8a786d632308168184c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761137341","capsul